\pard\b\fs20 Ghost Mine\b0\par
\fs16\par
This mine was once closed because of supernatural phenomena. But now that uranium is running short, and once again a megalomaniac Clonk has come to power, the order has been given to reopen the mine and to mine all of its uranium.\par
\par
\b Goal:\b0\par
Uranium mining\par
\par
\b Starting age:\b0\par
Modern age\par
\par
\b But beware:\b0\par
The mine is home to zombies and ghosts.\par
